# React & TypeScript Conventions

- Use functional components with explicit prop interfaces
- Avoid `any` — use proper types from `src/types/`
- Lazy-load page components via React Router
- Use TanStack Query for async data fetching (when implemented)
- Use React Hook Form + Zod for forms (when implemented)
- Prefer `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional classes
- Extract reusable UI into `src/components/` — not duplicated per page

## File Placement
- Pages: `src/pages/{auth,customer,agent,admin}/`
- Shared UI: `src/components/ui/` (shadcn)
- Domain components: `src/components/{claims,policies,customers,dashboard}/`
- Layout: `src/components/layout/`

## Example
```tsx
interface ClaimCardProps {
  claim: Claim
}

export function ClaimCard({ claim }: ClaimCardProps) {
  return (/* ... */)
}
```
